Z||000017||terryk||10-02-2000||09:53 PM||||I played with some intercoolers and GM's Eaton's just don't lend themselves to intercooler and the Thrasher setup looks stupid. <P>Water injection is the best compromise. Aquamist. I can crank in 4-5 more degrees. Extremely noticable.<P>Aquamist is one of the better systems.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.aquamist.co.uk/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.aquamist.co.uk/</A> <BR><p>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 10-02-2000).]||||reg||12
